        "headline": "Correspondence: published values for FY2020 and how they moved.",
        "statements": [
          {
            "text": "In FY2020, Correspondence per household was 125.1 (pieces per household per year). That rose by 7.6 (6.5%) from the previous year, FY2019. That fell by 17.3 (12.1%) from five years earlier, FY2015.",
            "metric": "correspondence-per-household",
            "years": [
              2020,
              2019,
              2015
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "In FY2020, Correspondence mail received per household was 104.0 (pieces per household per year). That fell by 5.2 (4.8%) from the previous year, FY2019. That rose by 5.2 (5.3%) from five years earlier, FY2015.",
            "metric": "correspondence-received-per-household",
            "years": [
              2020,
              2019,
              2015
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "In FY2020, First-Class correspondence received was 14,005 (millions of pieces). That fell by 98 (0.7%) from the previous year, FY2019. That fell by 999 (6.7%) from five years earlier, FY2015.",
            "metric": "fcm-received-correspondence",
            "years": [
              2020,
              2019,
              2015
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "In FY2020, First-Class correspondence sent was 3,346 (millions of pieces). That rose by 27 (0.8%) from the previous year, FY2019. That fell by 1,261 (27.4%) from five years earlier, FY2015.",
            "metric": "fcm-sent-correspondence",
            "years": [
              2020,
              2019,
              2015
            ]
          }
        ],
        "caveats": [
